Description: native private proxy plugin for the Deepin control center
 Manage Mihomo subscriptions, proxy nodes, latency tests, connections,
 rules, overrides, system proxy and PAC bypass settings in the V25 control
 center.
 The plugin is a QML module (plugins_v1.1/dccproxy) for dde-control-center
 6.1; the independent dde-mihomo-daemon, managed as a systemd user service,
 keeps the proxy running after the control center closes.
